    "title": "Nebraska State Fair celebrates award winners from 2026 Galaxy of Stars talent contest - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Carol Bryant ,\n7 hours ago GRAND ISLAND – Winners of the Galaxy of Stars® Talent Search from the Nebraska State Fair have been announced. The Nebraska State Fair and Vision Productions, Inc. have partnered for 20 years to bring the Galaxy of Stars® Talent Search Finals to the State Fair. The event was held at 6 p.m. Sunday, Aug. 30 on the ACP Park Stage at the State Fair. Read full article\n3",
